    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little Aquarium is a cozy relaxing idle game where you build and care for your own little underwater world. Buy fish, feed them in real time, and sell them to grow your aquarium empire! Unlock rare species, discover dazzling color variants, and decorate your tank to create the creative aquatic paradise of your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a cute little fish tank on your desktop while working \u2014 it won\u2019t disrupt your workflow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress in the game as you make progress in your day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a variety of fish through a fun gacha system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise your fish and earn money by selling them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your tank with special environmental effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize and decorate your tank to your liking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover super rare fishes with super cool effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Pictures:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf65 If you have some free time at work, just feed your fishes with the feeding frenzy to grow them up massively!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858150/extras/b5cce2091f6ae85b7146fef2f7957168.poster.avif?t=1754408298\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858150/extras/b5cce2091f6ae85b7146fef2f7957168.webm?t=1754408298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858150/extras/b5cce2091f6ae85b7146fef2f7957168.mp4?t=1754408298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc1f Check the huge collection of the beautiful pixel art fishes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858150/extras/c7a27e5b6215101138c412dd5e8d6775.poster.avif?t=1754408298\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858150/extras/c7a27e5b6215101138c412dd5e8d6775.webm?t=1754408298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858150/extras/c7a27e5b6215101138c412dd5e8d6775.mp4?t=1754408298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Unlock fish and super rare fish by gacha the booster pack!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858150/extras/2784dbe075dce4c3b76e48fb1be510b8.poster.avif?t=1754408298\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858150/extras/2784dbe075dce4c3b76e48fb1be510b8.webm?t=1754408298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858150/extras/2784dbe075dce4c3b76e48fb1be510b8.mp4?t=1754408298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come on, the game is so cool with super cheap price already, give us your money!!! NOW!!\u00a0\u00a0<strong>\ud83d\ude08\ud83d\ude08</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
